		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to the wonderful world of Licet Amice Pluvius Mundus! In these lands, three creeds have formed, each with their own beliefs and technologies. The next page will give you a quick summary of each faction."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"-The &9&lWizards&r, as the name suggests, are the most advanced spellcasters. Alongside that, they're also fantastic engineers."
				"-The &a&lAvians&r, despite their name, are not birds themselves (not all of them, at least), rather they're a cult who worships birds. Despite how silly they may sound, they're proficient chemists and are well versed in the art of hematic alchemy."
				"-The &8&lTitanborn&r are a group of people who worship psychoactive substances of all kinds, believing them to be gifts from their gods, the titular titans. Their arts are strictly connected to aspects of nature that the titans represent, such as druidry and smithing."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Whichever path you choose won't lock you out of further exploring the specializations of other factions, but you won't be able to reap the rewards of the quest book."
			]
